diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 1b189598e7..ba3b0c735e 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -34,6 +34,9 @@ Upgrading directly from 4.1.x no longer preserves entity registry customizations
